"안녕하세요 <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-"
"out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>)님,</t>\n"
"                    <t t-else=\"\">안녕하세요 <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/"
">ㄴ;ㅁ,</t>\n"
